==== hyperbricks yaml {!{page}} ====
page:
  - type: hypermedia
  - route: duplicate-item-name-collision

  - content:
      - type: tree

      - text_summary:
          - type: text
          - value: First

      - text_summary_2:
          - type: text
          - value: Explicit second

      - text_summary:
          - type: text
          - value: Recovered third
==== explainer ====
Generated duplicate names never overwrite an existing sibling.
If text_summary_2 already exists, the recovered duplicate becomes text_summary_3.
==== expected json ====
{
  "@order": [
    "content"
  ],
  "@type": "<HYPERMEDIA>",
  "content": {
    "@order": [
      "text_summary",
      "text_summary_2",
      "text_summary_3"
    ],
    "@type": "<TREE>",
    "text_summary": {
      "@type": "<TEXT>",
      "value": "First"
    },
    "text_summary_2": {
      "@type": "<TEXT>",
      "value": "Explicit second"
    },
    "text_summary_3": {
      "@type": "<TEXT>",
      "value": "Recovered third"
    }
  },
  "route": "duplicate-item-name-collision"
}
==== expected diagnostics ====
[
  {
    "type": "YAML",
    "path": "page.content",
    "key": "text_summary",
    "level": "WARNING",
    "contains": "using \"text_summary_3\" as runtime path"
  }
]
==== expected output ====
<!DOCTYPE html><html><body>FirstExplicit secondRecovered third</body></html>
